rooms_desc ({"You are standing in the middle of a huge desert. There iswhite sand as far as you can see in every direction, and thesun overhead is beating down mercilessly, making you feel the need to consume vast quantities of alcohol. In the distance tothe north you can just distinguish the outline of Blark'shouse. A small black hole in the air behind you will takeyou to the church, the guild or the shop. There are some blueaardvarks fluttering happily around in the sky above. Asolitary dead aardvark lies nosedived in the sand nearby.","You are standing in the front garden of Blark's lovely house,which lies to your north. The house seems to defy gravity - buttresses, towers and balconies jut out at strange angles andit is much taller than you would think possible. Around you inthe garden are many brightly coloured plants and trees, and thelawn is lush and verdant despite the searing heat. In the centreof the lawn is a large, spectacular fountain which bubbles withsparkling water. Many small furry creatures frolic happily aroundthe garden, whilst large scary ones lurk in the shadows of thetrees. Behind a distant hedge to the east you can see a largeastroturf football pitch.","You have entered the main room of the newlymatured Blark's house. He has removed all thesilly pictures and football trophied and tidiedup considerably. Remarkably, at such short notice,he has lined the walls with huge bookcases stuffedwith scholarly volumes. In fact, Blark is so mature nowthat he's not even going to complete this description.So there.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"You are in the middle of a large desert.","You are standing in Blark's front garden","Mature room.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
