items ({({"aardvark","A dead aardvark with a blunt nose. What did you expect?","hole","An infinitely deep and very dark hole. Odd, eh?","sand","The sand Is blindingly white and very hot. Ouch","sand","The sand is blindingly white and very hot. Ouch","sun","It's the sun, stupid","sky","Big and blue",}),({"door","The front door of Blark's house. It is a nice shade of purple","trees","Blark has planted many types of trees here, including a few banana trees","lawn","It's a lawn, stupid",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
